OL,3,AMissiles hit Kyiv after Russia agrees
OL,4,Ato US call to resume Ukraine peace
OL,5,Atalks
OL,6,
OL,7,FUkraine's capital has come under a new
OL,8,Fmissile attack, hours after Russia said
OL,9,Fit was "ready in principle" to resume
OL,10,Fpeace talks and the US president said
OL,11,Fthe world was "the closest we've been"
OL,12,Fto ending the war.
OL,14,FSeveral houses were hit on Wednesday
OL,15,Fnight, injuring six people, Kyiv Mayor
OL,16,FVitaliy Klitschko said.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
